---
import Card from '../Card.astro'
---

<Card colSpan="md:col-span-1" rowSpan="md:row-span-6" title="About me">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      Hi, I'm Daniel, a software engineer from Mexico. Throughout my career, I’ve worked with a wide range of technologies covering front-end, back-end, and databases. From JavaScript, React, and Astro for building dynamic interfaces, to Node.js, Python, and PHP for server-side development, along with databases like MongoDB and SQL. I bring versatility and depth to my projects.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm font-light">
      Outside of coding, I enjoy video games, basketball, and exploring new places. I'm also passionate about collecting watches, a hobby that blends technical precision with style.
    </p>
  </div>
</Card>
